    {
      "name": "get_picture",
      "title": "See the picture",
      "description": "See the program picture: exactly what viewers see, or what a recording would capture, as a JPEG at most 1280 pixels wide. Works while idle, so you can check a scene before going live. Windows the streamer left out of the scene are never in it.",
